{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t特區政府與中國香港殘疾人奧委會舉行嘉許禮，表揚中國香港代表團在第五屆亞洲殘疾人運動會取得佳績。<br/>\n<br/>\n出席嘉許禮的行政長官李家超，讚揚港隊代表以永不言敗的香港精神，身體力行說好香港故事。他表示，政府會繼續支持殘疾運動發展，讓運動員勇敢實現夢想，為香港爭光。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:40:40.207256+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T11:19:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T18:59:58.525504+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:34:12.129169+00:00","content_hash":"0da49f539fc768863bddb139d02bb8b3371b4ff9fb6a6246126a2cadf7a9a9c2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}